&lt;p&gt;Welcome to &lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Crafts &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;on the Corner&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;, an exciting new event series at the &lt;a href="https://theforum.columbia.edu/" target="_blank"&gt;Lee C. Bollinger&amp;nbsp;Forum&lt;/a&gt;. This initiative aims to provide accessible and free opportunities for individuals within the community to explore their artistic potential, enhance their crafting skills, and cultivate a sense of community through shared creative experiences. It&amp;#39;s a celebration of creativity and an opportunity to connect with neighbors in a fun and enriching environment. Open to all ages!&lt;/p&gt;
